{"slug":"Entry-Point-Deimos-80415","_id":"6955286826c0f7bff727b2de","title":"Deimos","game":{"_id":"67e5e1ffb360710ec3c784ec","gameId":740581508,"name":"Entry Point","imageUrl":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-game.webp","original":null},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-game.webp","original":null},"placeId":740581508},"features":"Deimos is an arsenal of commands for complete domination over everything that happens in the game. The Entry Point code has been disassembled piece by piece by the hackers from Halcyon, so now you have 65 commands at your disposal. With one command, you can, for example, disarm an entire squad of special forces, kill them, or send them into space. The script can make all your teammates immortal, destroy any boss in the blink of an eye, or complete any mission from the main story. For example, it takes 40 seconds to complete the scientist on legendary difficulty, so your character can reach level 75 from level 1 in 25-30 minutes.\n\nAnd of course, the script is full of commands to troll your teammates while they dont understand whats going on. You can hide all npcs in a mission, steal any items and weapons from inventories (including weapons of npcs), make all npcs crawl instead of walk, show your teammates your suppressed thumper or sawblade, make npcs immortal, enable global esp and much more.\n\nThe script has an open-source code, so you can join the Deimos community to develop and fix the script together, or simply leave your feedback or suggestions about the script.\n\nLinks\n\nDiscord invite: https://discord.gg/AsWAVd5dqf\nDeimos GitHub repository: https://github.com/deimos-ep/deimos","tags":["godmode","entry point","teleport","noclip","autofarm"],"script":"--[[\nDiscord: https://discord.gg/AsWAVd5dqf\nGitHub: https://github.com/deimos-ep/deimos\n]]--\n\nloadstring(game:HttpGet(\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/deimos-ep/deimos/refs/heads/main/compiled.luau\"))()","owner":{"_id":"620fd5bf679bc69e774c39c5","username":"